          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Organization members are users who have access to your Capgo organization. Each member has a specific role that determines their permissions within the organization. Managing members effectively is crucial for maintaining security and collaboration in your team."
        }
      ]
    },
