          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 33,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Add a new member to an organization or update an existing member's role. Note that you can only invite users who already have a Capgo account - the email must correspond to an existing Capgo user."
        }
      ]
    },
